line	<str>Speak with the Gossip using all three options.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel south to the Seer's Village courthouse. (South-East of the bank).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Anna.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk down the stairs to begin the trial.</str>
line	
line	<str>Call the Dog Handler as a witness. Ask him about the poison.</str>
line	
line	<str>Call the Butler as a witness by speaking to the judge. Ask him about the dagger.</str>
line	
line	<str>Call the Maid as a witness. Ask her about the night of the murder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Ask the Maid (or anyone else) about the thread.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the courtroom by clicking on the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak again with Anna in her cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head east around Camelot Castle, past the gate and to the north-east. Search the statue to start a cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Merlin inside the cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Reach for the vent at the north of the cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use Telekinetic Grab on the guard fixing his hair outside the cell</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the <col=800000>Hair clip</col> or lockpick on the door to start a puzzle.</col>
