line	<str>Head east around Camelot Castle, past the gate and to the north-east. Search the statue to start a cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Merlin inside the cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Reach for the vent at the north of the cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use Telekinetic Grab on the guard fixing his hair outside the cell</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the Hair clip or lockpick on the door to start a puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the staircases until you reach the top floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the table.</str>
line	
line	<str>Choose the round purple box second from the right.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Wizard Cromperty in Ardougne to receive an Animate rock scroll.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the Black Knights' Fortress west of Edgeville/north of Ice Mountain. (Amulet of glory or combat bracelet (Monastery) provide convenient teleports)</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the black armour and enter the Black Knights' Fortress through the Sturdy door on the south wall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the wall to the north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Free King Arthur from his statue (requires the granite).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to King Arthur to give him the <col=800000>bronze med helm</col> and <col=800000>iron chainbody</col>.</col>
step	35	-	Quick guide step 35
line	<str>Speak with Gossip outside of Sinclair Mansion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with the guard in the courtyard to the north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Break into the Smashed Window on the East side of the mansion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Grab the Scrap paper in the dining room next to the fire place (uk=0).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go up the stairs to the uk=1 and then to the library in the centre.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the Address Form off the table and read it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the bookcase on the Western wall for a Black knight helm.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the guard via the smashed window.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to him, using all three options so that he takes each of your three items</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with the Gossip using all three options.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel south to the Seer's Village courthouse. (South-East of the bank).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Anna.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk down the stairs to begin the trial.</str>
line	
line	<str>Call the Dog Handler as a witness. Ask him about the poison.</str>
line	
line	<str>Call the Butler as a witness by speaking to the judge. Ask him about the dagger.</str>
line	
line	<str>Call the Maid as a witness. Ask her about the night of the murder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Ask the Maid (or anyone else) about the thread.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the courtroom by clicking on the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak again with Anna in her cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head east around Camelot Castle, past the gate and to the north-east. Search the statue to start a cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Merlin inside the cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Reach for the vent at the north of the cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use Telekinetic Grab on the guard fixing his hair outside the cell</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the Hair clip or lockpick on the door to start a puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the staircases until you reach the top floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the table.</str>
line	
line	<str>Choose the round purple box second from the right.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Wizard Cromperty in Ardougne to receive an Animate rock scroll.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the Black Knights' Fortress west of Edgeville/north of Ice Mountain. (Amulet of glory or combat bracelet (Monastery) provide convenient teleports)</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the black armour and enter the Black Knights' Fortress through the Sturdy door on the south wall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the wall to the north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Free King Arthur from his statue (requires the granite).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to King Arthur to give him the bronze med helm and iron chainbody.</str>
